     * h(x[]) = combiner(...combiner(combiner(initialValue,f(x[0])),f(x[1]))...),f(x[x.length-1]))
     * </code></pre>
     *
     * @param combiner Combiner function.
     * @param f Function.
     * @param initialValue Initial value.
