            // where P_n(x) is a degree n-1 polynomial with same parity as n-1
            // P_1(x) = 1, P_2(x) = x, P_3(x) = 2x^2 + 1 ...
            // the general recurrence relation for P_n is:
            // P_n(x) = (1-x^2) P_(n-1)'(x) + (2n-3) x P_(n-1)(x)
