   * double-width).
   *
   * <p><b>Note:</b> as the reference file evolves, we will modify this matcher to keep it up to
   * date.
   *
   * <p>See also <a href="http://www.unicode.org/reports/tr11/">UAX #11 East Asian Width</a>.
